name: "Mahmoud Elboghdady"
github_repo_root_url: https://github.com/jarviscanada/jarvis_data_eng_MahmoudElboghdady

summary: "Results-driven Business Systems Analyst with hands-on experience in data analytics, BI development, and process optimization. Proven ability to translate business requirements into technical solutions using SQL, Python, and Power BI across real-world industry projects. Adept at working across the full data lifecycle from pipeline development to dashboard delivery. Holds IBM Data Science and DataCamp Power BI certifications, with strong foundations in agile environments and cross-functional collaboration. Actively seeking BSA or data analyst roles where analytical depth and business acumen drive measurable impact."

skills:
  proficient:
